38. Powers of Food Safety Officer.-(1) The Food Safety Officer may- (a) take a sample- (i) of any food, or any substance, which appears to him to be intended for sale, or to have been sold for human consumption; or (ii) of any article of food or substance which is found by him on or in any such premises;
